-- ---------------------------------------------------------------- every space's data computed once
-- The machine shares an argument's value but not a repeated subexpression, so each space's kernel, monomials and
-- minimal polynomial are computed once and passed. A vertex's data: its m, its projector coefficients Σ_k m[k+1+p] M^k,
-- its dimension, free columns, weight-zero monomials and kernel basis.
VW : Type
VW = List SQ × (List Rows × (Nat × (List Nat × (Mons × Rows))))
